#X text 20 600 The unit is cleared before it is set: list split 1 sends nothing right when nothing is left over \, so grain 12 after chop-size 43 % would draw as grain 12 %. C-7, f 58;
#X text 900 470 makefilename %g makes the value a symbol: packOSC types every atom after the header as s and refuses a float., f 46;
#X text 900 600 So disp parameter values are floats: a symbol would be refused by makefilename %g., f 46;
