#X text 20 580 Every branch out of route goes through list append: a remainder starting with a symbol arrives as a selector \, which a trigger cannot convert (Reference \, pure-data)., f 58;
#X text 560 580 A remainder starting with a float \, out-l 43 dB \, really is a list \, which is why the level chain needs no list append., f 58;
#X text 1100 580 modal-off carries nothing \, so route sends a bang straight to the layer logic. Clearing a layer is not setting one \, hence a name of its own., f 58;
#X text 1100 700 led and grid are matched and left unconnected: they are g_led's and g_grid's \, and would otherwise draw as parameter rows., f 58;
#X obj 1900 420 s \$0-on-diag;
#X text 1900 480 diag carries nothing \, like modal-off. It is the ninth argument \, appended: one slotted in anywhere else renumbers every outlet after it \, the reject included. u_net's route matches it (ref/module/display.md)., f 58;
