#X text 20 1120 The draw order is the trigger order \, rightmost first: info bar off \, clear \, the winning layer \, flip. Nothing reaches the display without gFlip., f 46;
#X text 420 1120 gShowInfoBar goes out on every frame: mother restores the info bar after loading a patch (Reference \, critter-guitari-organelle-1)., f 46;
#X text 820 1120 The metro starts after 300 ms: mother is still settling just after load., f 46;
#X text 1220 1120 Everything that reaches the screen converges on this one s oscOut. C-5, f 46;
#X text 1220 1250 A parameter that arrives under a modal is stored and runs its TTL \; if the modal clears in time \, it appears., f 58;
#N canvas 30 30 1600 2350 params 0;
#X text 20 20 The parameter store: up to five lines of <frame-stamp> <name> <value> <unit>. Everything after the name is drawn as it stands \, so a missing unit needs no placeholder., f 58;
#X text 20 160 Rows do not move once a control has one: it is updated in place \, and a new one is appended below. Moving the latest to the front made two faders swap places several times a second., f 58;
