#X text 20 930 expect is the only branch that appends \, once per source at load. list split fires its remainder first \, so the kind's starting code is parked before the name writes. An unknown kind registers nothing., f 58;
#X text 900 890 seen and back both mean here. The spigot stops a write for a source that never registered \, which would land on whatever row the last message left parked. C-8, f 58;
#X text 1900 1160 lost is conditional: c_presence publishes it unarmed \, so only a row that has been here becomes gone \, and one still at 0 stays never seen. The code is read back from the store \, one source of truth. C-8, f 70;
